BIP-39 English word list
=======================

src/rules/bip39-english.txt matches the English word list distributed by
trezor/python-mnemonic, the BIP-39 reference implementation.

Source: https://github.com/trezor/python-mnemonic/blob/master/src/mnemonic/wordlist/english.txt
License: https://github.com/trezor/python-mnemonic/blob/master/LICENSE
Specification: https://github.com/bitcoin/bips/blob/master/bip-0039.mediawiki

